# Called by a system-level capability engine (e.g. an arm-error recovery
# handler) once, at startup, to join the Orchestrator's error-recovery
# registry. Separate from RegisterEngine/CapabilityManifest since a system
# engine is not bound to any perceived object -- see
# SystemCapabilityManifest's own header comment for why.

rammp_orchestrator_interfaces/SystemCapabilityManifest manifest
---
bool accepted
string message
